You seem to be pretty good at doublespeak yourself. How can existence not 
be existence? Why do you believe it makes sense to say that "You cannot 
access reality infallibly" is an infallible statement of reality? This 
sounds more like an Epimenides paradox to me. Did you forget to put a 
smiley on that joke?

You seem to want to make me out to be some sort of moral relativist. 
